  "evidence": [
    {
      "id": "L01",
      "finding": "IE tick期限达到时discard后仍调用super；精确Forge AbstractArrow的碰撞while条件为!isRemoved，并在循环后再检查removed立即return。IE补充方块检测也要求!removed。",
      "sources": [
        {
          "source": "IEProjectileEntity",
          "ranges": [
            [
              141,
              179
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "source": "AbstractArrow",
          "ranges": [
            [
              176,
              225
            ]
          ]
        }
      ],
      "limit": "因此不能仅凭没有return宣称到期后仍通过这些路径再次命中。Entity.baseTick等先行副作用仍可能发生；不声称对象此刻完全停止一切代码。",
      "credit_added": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "L02",
      "finding": "Forge原生箭impact分支区分SKIP_ENTITY、STOP_AT_CURRENT_NO_DAMAGE、STOP_AT_CURRENT和DEFAULT；IE补充方块检查却用旧布尔包装，任何非DEFAULT都被当作不继续。",
      "sources": [
        {
          "source": "AbstractArrow",
          "ranges": [
            [
              182,
              220
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "source": "ForgeEventFactory",
          "ranges": [
            [
              672,
              685
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "source": "IEProjectileEntity",
          "ranges": [
            [
              169,
              178
            ]
          ]
        }
      ],
      "limit": "这是两处调用对同一返回值的不同解释，不能用DEFAULT单一路径代表所有事件监听器；没有运行事件。",
      "credit_added": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "L03",
      "finding": "ChemthrowerShot覆写onHit，没调super.onHit/onHitEntity/onHitBlock。原版箭的中箭计数、失败反向、常规命中discard不由此入口自动执行；但它仍经过原生tick的碰撞搜索。",
      "sources": [
